    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The 1935 William & Mary Indians football team represented William & Mary during the 1935 college football season. The opener against the Virginia Cavaliers was the first-ever game played at William & Mary's brand new Cary Field. The game ended in a 0–0 tie.",
